Positional: CPython's \"expected N argument(s), got M\", \"at least\", \"at most\"."] [766 1 "// parseKwOnly binds npos positional-only parameters and the keyword-only ones (names): CPython's"] [767 1 "// _PyArg_UnpackKeywords for a signature \"(a, b, /, *, k1, k2)\". The keyword-only ones absent are nil."] [793 1 "// writableExporter is writableBuffer's last case: an exporter of writable memory of another file (queue 204: mmap's"] [794 1 "// WritableBytes), else getargs' TypeError."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[18 30] [26 24] [44 37] [58 22] [66 24] [86 23] [123 12] [123 21] [125 13] [125 20] [139 12] [139 21] [141 13] [141 20] [172 6] [172 18] [194 6] [194 20] [215 26] [215 50] [240 12] [240 27] [336 25] [342 35] [344 49] [372 14] [372 27] [373 14] [373 23] [379 7] [379 19] [387 6] [387 17] [390 13] [390 26] [392 13] [392 22] [417 12] [417 27] [505 20] [550 62] [553 71] [564 36] [567 46] [633 32] [648 33] [651 43] [664 37] [667 47] [685 35] [688 47] [697 37] [796 75] [797 32]]} (go/file "builtins_binascii.go" :imports [

